OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,700 'unsafe' toys
OL,4,Aseized in shop raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,700 unsafe action figures,
OL,7,Fsquishy toys and stuffed teddies have
OL,8,Fbeen seized from shops across North
OL,9,FEast Lincolnshire.
OL,11,FThe council said the children's toys
OL,12,Fwere removed from stores in the area
OL,13,Fafter being deemed unsafe or confirmed
OL,14,Fto be fake.
OL,16,FIssues with the toys included missing
OL,17,Fsafety marks, unsafe battery storage,
OL,18,Fpoor construction or electrical wiring
OL,19,Fand choking hazards, the authority
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
