OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,700 'unsafe' toys
OL,4,Aseized in shop raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Sawkins, portfolio holder for
OL,7,Fsafer and stronger communities at North
OL,8,FEast Lincolnshire Council (NELC), said:
OL,9,F"It's quite surprising just how many
OL,10,Funsafe toys have been seized."
